# MuJoCo writes this into the CWD whenever the model warns (rehearsals, smoke tests)
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT

# Session checkpoints are committed on purpose (see checkpoints/<date>/README.md for the
# recipe and measured result behind each file) — the global *.pt / *.onnx ignores above
# would otherwise drop them silently.
!checkpoints/**/*.pt
!checkpoints/**/*.onnx
